{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11231020","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11231020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1123102001:1":{"text":"우리 둘 다 잘 알고 있을 겁니다, 크루거 님.\n아니, 이제는... 크루거 족장님이라고 불러야겠군요.","source_cn":"你和我都清楚，克鲁格大人。\\n哼，也许现在应该说……克...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C6E46B04E993CB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1123102002:1":{"text":"전장에서 전사하지 못한 건 유감이지만, 여기에 계속 머무르는 건 우리에게는 굴욕만 될 뿐입니다.","source_cn":"不能战死沙场已经是我们的遗憾了，继续留在这里只会让我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8E41D0D0D7B4C23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1123102003:1":{"text":"진정해, 퀴파.\n크루거 족장님도 악의는 없었을 거야...","source_cn":"冷静点，奎帕。\\n克鲁格族长没有恶意……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x566BAB5733805AB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1123102004:1":{"text":"악의가 없다고? 하쉬르가 어떻게 떠났는지 너도 봤을 텐데?","source_cn":"没有恶意？哈什尔是怎么离开的，你应该清楚的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x377AA2BBBA76709F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1123102005:1":{"text":"하쉬르 님... 에휴.","source_cn":"哈什尔大人……唉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEDD376BC623820D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title